  "details": "Hello. I am making a feature request to VRChat to hopefully convince them to opt in and allow VRChat to run on virtual machines. A few days ago I asked for an update on the Easy Anti-Cheat situation with Shadow PC and they gave me one final update, reading that Epic Games updated it so developers can make VMs an exception, allowing Virtual Machines to play the games that use EAC. I am here to ask VRChat if they can do this to help and let Shadow PC players play VRChat, after being locked out of it since January. They've said it was out of their control, but it seems like it isn't anymore, alongside other developers that use Easy Anti-Cheat. So for all people who use Shadow PC to play Shadow PC specifically to play VRChat in both VR and Non-VR mode, we would appreciate it if you take this into consideration. I will place a screenshot of the email below.\n\nThank you for your time.",
